    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist-tac-toe is a fun, turn-based, game based on tic-tac-toe with extra twists which bring a new dimension to a classic game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Twists and turns</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561860/extras/f2ef88c60f84bdc62d1828c9a255da2a.poster.avif?t=1750121631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561860/extras/f2ef88c60f84bdc62d1828c9a255da2a.webm?t=1750121631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561860/extras/f2ef88c60f84bdc62d1828c9a255da2a.mp4?t=1750121631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Super tic-tac-toe</strong></u>: We heard you like tic-tac-toe, so we put tic-tac-toe inside a game of tic-tac-toe. But be careful, winning one of the smaller games of tic-tac-toe may allow your opponent to place their own winning piece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mis\u00e8re</strong></u>: You and your opponent play as <strong>X</strong> but you lose if you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Play bigger, play smaller</strong></u>: This is not your grandparent\u2019s 3x3 tic-tac-toe. Play from 2x2 sizes upwards, in normal mode, super-tic-tac-toe mode, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Head to head</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Long or short?</strong></u> Play with game modes that support shorter casual games or longer strategic matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Challenge friends</strong></u>: Share a game with a friend and play via shared-screen, or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play against community members</u></strong>: Match against other players to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go solo with puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Build your skills in solo mode</strong></u>: Solve a variety of puzzles for fun or to improve your technique. Or play competitive modes against computer opponents of varying skill.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist-tac-toe is a fun, turn-based, game based on tic-tac-toe with extra twists which bring a new dimension to a classic game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Twists and turns</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561860/extras/f2ef88c60f84bdc62d1828c9a255da2a.poster.avif?t=1750121631\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561860/extras/f2ef88c60f84bdc62d1828c9a255da2a.webm?t=1750121631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561860/extras/f2ef88c60f84bdc62d1828c9a255da2a.mp4?t=1750121631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Super tic-tac-toe</strong></u>: We heard you like tic-tac-toe, so we put tic-tac-toe inside a game of tic-tac-toe. But be careful, winning one of the smaller games of tic-tac-toe may allow your opponent to place their own winning piece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mis\u00e8re</strong></u>: You and your opponent play as <strong>X</strong> but you lose if you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Play bigger, play smaller</strong></u>: This is not your grandparent\u2019s 3x3 tic-tac-toe. Play from 2x2 sizes upwards, in normal mode, super-tic-tac-toe mode, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Head to head</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Long or short?</strong></u> Play with game modes that support shorter casual games or longer strategic matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Challenge friends</strong></u>: Share a game with a friend and play via shared-screen, or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play against community members</u></strong>: Match against other players to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go solo with puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Build your skills in solo mode</strong></u>: Solve a variety of puzzles for fun or to improve your technique. Or play competitive modes against computer opponents of varying skill.</p>",
